1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,463
Honey Bunny Kidz presents:

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:06,000
Ollie Owl's Animal Sounds Song!

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,835
Get ready to sing,

4
00:00:07,835 --> 00:00:09,250
and move with us!

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,061
The sun was going down.

6
00:00:14,061 --> 00:00:16,550
Little lanterns began to glow.

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,092
Pip, look!

8
00:00:18,092 --> 00:00:21,200
This big tree stump is just like a little stage!

9
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:22,722
Woof woof!

10
00:00:22,722 --> 00:00:25,276
Let's sing the Wiggle Waggle Song again!

11
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:27,626
Hoo... hoo...

12
00:00:28,026 --> 00:00:29,483
Listen! Who is that?

13
00:00:29,483 --> 00:00:31,701
Can you guess who says hoo, hoo?

14
00:00:35,601 --> 00:00:37,088
It was Ollie Owl!

15
00:00:37,088 --> 00:00:38,501
He just woke up.

16
00:00:38,851 --> 00:00:41,851
Owls wake up when the sun goes down.

17
00:00:42,601 --> 00:00:43,663
Hoo, hoo!

18
00:00:43,663 --> 00:00:45,876
Good evening, friends!

19
00:00:46,226 --> 00:00:48,551
May I sing with you?

20
00:00:49,301 --> 00:00:50,405
Yes, Ollie!

21
00:00:50,405 --> 00:00:52,376
Let's make a new song.

22
00:00:52,726 --> 00:00:54,811
Every friend makes a sound,

23
00:00:54,811 --> 00:00:56,201
and shows a move!

24
00:00:56,951 --> 00:00:59,413
Then I will be the song leader,

25
00:00:59,413 --> 00:01:01,151
up here on the stage.

26
00:01:01,501 --> 00:01:04,001
Here is our new chorus!

27
00:01:06,651 --> 00:01:08,976
Everybody, sing with us!

28
00:01:09,776 --> 00:01:12,401
Wiggle, waggle, one, two, three!

29
00:01:12,901 --> 00:01:15,376
Make a sound and sing with me!

30
00:01:15,876 --> 00:01:18,626
Flap and hop and turn around.

31
00:01:19,126 --> 00:01:22,001
Every friend has a special sound!

32
00:01:24,801 --> 00:01:25,983
Me first!

33
00:01:25,983 --> 00:01:28,051
Owls say hoo, hoo.

34
00:01:28,401 --> 00:01:31,326
And we flap our soft wings.

35
00:01:32,076 --> 00:01:34,776
Ollie Owl says hoo, hoo, hoo.

36
00:01:35,176 --> 00:01:36,576
Flap your wings,

37
00:01:36,576 --> 00:01:37,976
the way owls do!

38
00:01:38,576 --> 00:01:40,313
Can you say hoo, hoo,

39
00:01:40,313 --> 00:01:42,701
and flap your arms like wings?

40
00:01:44,701 --> 00:01:45,839
Hoo, hoo!

41
00:01:45,839 --> 00:01:47,926
Wonderful flapping!

42
00:01:48,676 --> 00:01:52,226
Owls can turn their heads very far.

43
00:01:52,576 --> 00:01:55,692
Can you turn your head slowly, this way,

44
00:01:55,692 --> 00:01:56,851
and that way?

45
00:02:00,751 --> 00:02:02,291
Baa! Hello, Ollie!

46
00:02:02,291 --> 00:02:04,345
May I sing my sound next?

47
00:02:05,095 --> 00:02:08,045
Lulu Lamb says baa, baa, baa.

48
00:02:08,445 --> 00:02:11,445
Bounce up high, then la, la, la!

49
00:02:12,045 --> 00:02:13,482
Can you say baa,

50
00:02:13,482 --> 00:02:15,147
like a little lamb?

51
00:02:17,147 --> 00:02:18,919
Baa! Now bounce with me.

52
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,428
Boing, boing, boing!

53
00:02:23,078 --> 00:02:24,492
Quack quack!

54
00:02:24,492 --> 00:02:25,528
My turn!

55
00:02:26,278 --> 00:02:29,653
Dotty Duckling says quack, quack, quack.

56
00:02:30,053 --> 00:02:32,753
Waddle forward, waddle back!

57
00:02:33,353 --> 00:02:36,003
Can you waddle like a duck?

58
00:02:36,353 --> 00:02:38,478
Waddle, waddle!

59
00:02:40,478 --> 00:02:42,130
Woof! Now me!

60
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,805
Pip the Puppy says woof, woof, hey!

61
00:02:46,205 --> 00:02:48,930
Wag your tail and jump to play!

62
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:53,680
Now, all together!

63
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:57,105
Wiggle, waggle, one, two, three!

64
00:02:57,605 --> 00:03:00,080
Make a sound and sing with me!

65
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:03,330
Flap and hop and turn around.

66
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:06,705
Every friend has a special sound!

67
00:03:09,505 --> 00:03:12,204
Meow! I want to sing too!

68
00:03:12,954 --> 00:03:15,679
Mimi Kitten says meow, meow.

69
00:03:16,079 --> 00:03:18,679
Stretch up tall and take a bow!

70
00:03:19,279 --> 00:03:20,764
Can you say meow,

71
00:03:20,764 --> 00:03:22,620
and take a little bow?

72
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:27,695
Hmm. Everyone has a big sound.

73
00:03:28,045 --> 00:03:30,695
But bunnies are very quiet.

74
00:03:31,045 --> 00:03:33,520
What is my sound, Ollie?

75
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:37,234
Hoo, hoo.

76
00:03:37,234 --> 00:03:40,070
I have very good ears, Honey.

77
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:43,245
I know two bunny sounds!

78
00:03:43,995 --> 00:03:47,245
Bunnies wiggle their little noses.

79
00:03:47,595 --> 00:03:48,774
Sniff, sniff.

80
00:03:48,774 --> 00:03:51,795
And bunnies talk with their back feet.

81
00:03:52,145 --> 00:03:53,870
Thump, thump!

82
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:55,881
Thump, thump!

83
00:03:55,881 --> 00:03:57,220
I can do that!

84
00:03:57,570 --> 00:04:00,170
That is my special sound!

85
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:03,595
Honey Bunny wiggles her nose.

86
00:04:03,995 --> 00:04:05,693
Thump, thump, thump,

87
00:04:05,693 --> 00:04:07,095
and up she goes!

88
00:04:07,695 --> 00:04:10,241
Can you wiggle your nose like a bunny,

89
00:04:10,241 --> 00:04:11,670
and stamp your foot?

90
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,645
Thump, thump!

91
00:04:15,645 --> 00:04:18,670
Yay! Quiet sounds are special too!

92
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:24,220
Sing it one more time, little friends!

93
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:27,645
Wiggle, waggle, one, two, three!

94
00:04:28,145 --> 00:04:30,620
Make a sound and sing with me!

95
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,870
Flap and hop and turn around.

96
00:04:34,370 --> 00:04:37,245
Every friend has a special sound!

97
00:04:38,145 --> 00:04:41,470
Which animal sound is your favorite?

98
00:04:41,820 --> 00:04:45,695
Hoo, baa, quack, woof, meow, or thump?

99
00:04:47,695 --> 00:04:49,534
I like them all!

100
00:04:49,534 --> 00:04:50,695
Hoo, hoo!

101
00:04:53,345 --> 00:04:56,045
The moon rose high and round.

102
00:04:56,395 --> 00:04:59,945
Mama Bunny came to walk the little friends home.

103
00:05:00,695 --> 00:05:02,345
What a lovely song!

104
00:05:02,345 --> 00:05:03,545
Before we go,

105
00:05:03,545 --> 00:05:05,870
let's do a quiet owl breath.

106
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:09,247
Breathe in slowly through your nose,

107
00:05:09,247 --> 00:05:11,470
and fill up like a fluffy owl.

108
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:14,673
And breathe out,

109
00:05:14,673 --> 00:05:16,445
soft as a feather.

110
00:05:16,795 --> 00:05:18,570
Hoo, hoo.

111
00:05:20,170 --> 00:05:21,739
Wiggle, waggle,

112
00:05:21,739 --> 00:05:23,220
soft and slow.

113
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,357
Goodnight, friends,

114
00:05:25,357 --> 00:05:26,770
it's time to go.

115
00:05:29,670 --> 00:05:32,595
Every friend has a special sound.

116
00:05:32,945 --> 00:05:34,352
Loud or quiet,

117
00:05:34,352 --> 00:05:36,670
every sound is wonderful!

118
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:41,520
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

119
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,992
Hoo, hoo!

120
00:05:42,992 --> 00:05:46,770
Goodnight! See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
